<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In A.1 VLM-RLAIF Specific Training Configurations ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Oracle-RLAIF: An Improved Fine-Tuning Framework for Multi-modal Video Models through Reinforcement Learning from Oracle Ranking Feedback" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Reward Model Trained with Context</span></a></li>
