<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Oracle-RLAIF: An Improved Fine-Tuning Framework for Multi-modal Video Models through Reinforcement Learning from Oracle Ranking Feedback</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
